{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "By the Time I'm 30", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Writes well organized texts about the application for a job in an international organization through the correct use of formality expressions, grammar, and coherence and cohesion aspects appropriate for this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Future Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can talk about the future in several different ways. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The auxiliary verb <span class=\"strong\">going to</span> is used to talk about intentions. (An intention is a future plan that you have already considered.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The auxiliary verb <span class=\"strong\">will</span> is used to form predictions or simple statements of fact about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Present Continuous tense is used to make arrangements. (An arrangement is a plan for the future that you have already considered <span class=\"strong\">and talked about with another person</span>.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Present Simple tense is used to talk about future events that are scheduled.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'm going to tell him my goals for the future and see whether he will consider making some changes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Maybe I'll ask my boss for a meeting to discuss my future.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Then, I will be looking for possible job opportunities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When does the meeting begin?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Future Continuous and Future Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The Future Continuous tense is used to show an unfinished action or event that will occur at a time in the future.<br/>The Future Perfect tense is used when you talk about a finished action in the future. When you use the tense, you are projecting yourself forward and looking back at the action. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The Future Continuous tense has two different forms:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\"<span class=\"italic\">will be doing</span>\" and \"<span class=\"italic\">be going to be doing</span>\" </div>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Your boss <span class=\"strong\">will be waiting</span> for you in her office. <br/>Your boss <span class=\"strong\">is going to be waiting</span> for you in her office.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Future Perfect tense also has two different forms: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\"<span class=\"italic\">will have done</span>\" and \"<span class=\"italic\">be going to have done</span>\" ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">will have agreed</span> on a new contract by the time you leave her office. <br/>You <span class=\"strong\">are going to have to</span> agree on a new contract by the time you leave her office.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I am still hoping that I will have achieved my professional goals before I turn thirty.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "By meeting with my boss before I make any decisions, I will have given her a chance to consider my future at Advantage Ads. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Soon, I will be hitting my breaking point.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Everyone has dreams about what they will be doing in the future. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You are going to have to tell me what happens.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "breaking point", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the time when problems become so great that a person can no longer deal with them", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will be hitting my breaking point soon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a workplace about someone's future in their job.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pace", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the \u200bspeed at which something \u200bhappens", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't know if I can keep up this pace indefinitely.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "grand", "type": "name"}, {"content": " something that is amazing because of it's size and significance, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She may have some grand plans for you in the agency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "advertising agency", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an agency employed by companies to create and manage their advertising campaigns", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are a number of advertising agencies downtown.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to eventuate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to happen as a result of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The boss had promised a pay raise and new job title but it hasn't eventuated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find the movie <span class=\"italic\">Back to the Future</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Watch the movie in English with subtitles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Take notes about some of the main events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Tell a friend about the movie.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I watch a movie about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I take notes on the main events in the movie.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I tell a friend about the movie.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le14ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">James</span>: It's been a long week! I'm exhausted.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kirk</span>: Me too. I don't know if I can keep up this pace indefinitely, especially since I am on such a low salary. I feel like they always take advantage of me.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">James</span>: Have you considered changing jobs? There are a number of advertising agencies downtown.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kirk</span>: Yeah, I think I'm going to consider my options. Soon, I'll be hitting my breaking point. The boss had promised a pay raise and new job title but it hasn't eventuated."}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "34000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">James</span>: I can understand your frustration. At your age, you should be starting to not only pay your bills but also be thinking about putting some money away in a savings account each month.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kirk</span>: Maybe I'll ask my boss for a meeting to discuss my future. I'm going to tell her my goals for the future and see whether she will consider making some changes.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">James</span>: Good idea. Everyone has dreams about what they will be doing in the future. If she is not prepared to have a frank discussion about your future with the agency, then be prepared to move on."}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob08re2img03.jpg", "time": "66000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kirk</span>: Exactly. By meeting with my boss before I make any decisions, I will have given her a chance to consider my future at Advantage Ads. Then, I will be looking for possible job opportunities.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">James</span>: You never know what might happen. She may have some grand plans for you in the agency.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kirk</span>: Maybe ... I am still hoping that I will have achieved my professional goals before I turn thirty.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">James</span>: You are going to have to tell me what happens."}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "5000", "id": 1, "text": "Writing About Work"}, {"image": "", "time": "41000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Workplace situations.</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "78000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use going to for intentions.</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "92000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use will for predictions and simple facts about the future.</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "107000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use the Present Continuous tense for arrangements.</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "119000", "id": 6, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Use the Present Simple tense for future scheduled events.</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn9le14ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can write about jobs, work and money.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about future action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever had a serious 